{"overview":"کرت روک‌هانز یک پسر کار دل‌سوز برای گروه قهرمانان «اژدهای شعله‌ور» است. روزی از گروه تبعید می‌شود و می‌فهمد که در ردهٔ نبرد پایین‌ترین رتبه را دارد. برای کسب معاش، کرت مشاغل مختلفی می‌گیرد و متوجه می‌شود توانایی‌های شگفت‌انگیزی دارد. اگرچه هنوز متوجه نشده، کرت مهارت‌های سطح SSS در همه چیز به جز مبارزه دارد و اکنون در مسیر سفری جدید قدم می‌گذارد.","tagline":"","overview_en":"Kurt Rockhans is a kind-hearted errand boy for a hero’s party, the Flaming Dragon Fang. One day, he's banished from the party and finds out he has the lowest rank in combat. In order to make a living, Kurt picks up various jobs and discovers he has astonishing abilities. Though he doesn't realize it yet, Kurt has SSS-rank skills in anything other than fighting, as he sets off on a new journey.","tagline_en":"","runtime":null,"status":"Ended","seasons":[{"n":0,"name":"ویژه‌ها","ep":14,"y":2025,"poster":""},{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":12,"y":2025,"poster":"/lp4rmeuBKeRk72YM8YGNleCjJuO.jpg"},{"n":2,"name":"فصل 2","ep":1,"y":null,"poster":""}],"episodes":13,"crew":[],"crew_en":[],"countries":["JP"],"cast":[{"name":"میکاکو کوماتسو","role":"Kurt Rockhans (voice)","photo":"/13tQEZ1tLdOmi7oGoRJ4xep1ODQ.jpg","en":"Mikako Komatsu"},{"name":"田中美海","role":"Liselotte Homuros (voice)","photo":"/cxuGdrWhQooTsE3TvjAwokyEkwr.jpg","en":"Minami Tanaka"},{"name":"瀬戸麻沙美","role":"Yulishia (voice)","photo":"/iKKCPgKrNd4pJ0iBOC1SBZy2Y4Y.jpg","en":"Asami Seto"},{"name":"金元寿子","role":"Mimico (voice)","photo":"/yosLId8iiPcvDZpeoLuGkDKlorU.jpg","en":"Hisako Kanemoto"},{"name":"ری تاناکا","role":"Ophilia (voice)","photo":"/wBWsjzwpFovyHDv027zU0oZyWHd.jpg","en":"Rie Tanaka"}],"trailer":"dtH0CW_7HGo","watch":{"US":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/277881-sss/watch?locale=US","p":[{"n":"Crunchyroll","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/uFL3c4Cq8M6WoLymlC5Y8bmGytV.png"},{"n":"Crunchyroll Amazon Channel","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/qHLLmKo7udRgiSnIASVTwP2IxfJ.png"},{"n":"Amazon Video","kind":"buy","logo":"/jn6TLbtaTZntTRX9U